@WebApplication.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5191

### List All Documents
GET {{WebApplication.API_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

### Document Details
GET {{WebApplication.API_HostAddress}}/api/documents/1
Accept: application/json

### Ask Question (All Documents)
POST {{WebApplication.API_HostAddress}}/api/chat/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the subject of these documents?"
}

### Ask Question (Specific Document)
POST {{WebApplication.API_HostAddress}}/api/chat/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the main subject of this document?",
  "documentId": 1
}

### Delete Document
DELETE {{WebApplication.API_HostAddress}}/api/documents/1

###
